SECTION 2 — GAME OF LIFE (2D CA)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Grid:
    • N × N binary matrix
    • Moore neighborhood (8 neighbors)

Update rule:
    neighbors = count of live neighbors
    next cell = 1 iff:
        neighbors == 3
        OR (cell == 1 AND neighbors == 2)

Code uses np.roll to compute neighbors efficiently.

